    "authoritativeText": [{"lesson": "geo68-c1-s5", "text": "* 在日常生活中，“在……之间”这个词组也应用于不在一条直线上的三点的情况．\n例如，沿着图12所示道路行进时，我们可以说点$B$在$A$和$D$两点之间，而点$D$在$B$和$C$两点之间．\n但是这和几何中采用的定义是不一致的．"}],
    "inventory": [{"id": "source-road", "description": "Actual source: one winding road extends from left arch through A, down through trough, up through B to upper hump D, then down through C to right lower tail. A,B,C lie on one horizontal baseline; D above between B/C horizontally and on the winding road. Route order A-B-D-C. Four source labels and dots, no lengths, arrows, scale or grid. Exact source curvature unmeasured, smoothly regularized; D remains a hump summit. The straight baseline extends left of A and right of C.", "objects": ["a","b","c","d","baseline","road"], "assertions": ["abc-collinear","ab-order","bc-order","bd-position","dc-position","baseline-connect"], "requires": ["pointRelationships"]}]
